For an NVM subsystem that supports NVM Sets (refer to section 3.2.2), the host may use the Identify command to access the NVM Set List data structure (refer to section 5.2.13.2.4) to determine the NVM Sets that are accessible by the controller and the capacity information for each of those NVM Sets.

