| Bits | Description |
|------|-------------|
| 127:00 | Data Pointer (DPTR): This field specifies the start of the data buffer. Refer to Figure 92 for the definition of this field. If no data structure is used as part of the specified feature (refer to the FID field), then this field shall be ignored by the controller. |

