| 09:08 | Number of Reachability Group Descriptors (NRGD): This field indicates the number of Reachability Group Descriptors available in the log page. The log page shall contain one Reachability Group Descriptor for each Reachability Group that contains namespaces that are attached to the controller. If, for a Reachability Group, there are no namespaces attached to the controller processing the command, then no Reachability Group Descriptor is returned for that Reachability Group (i.e., a Reachability Group Descriptor is returned only if that Reachability Group contains namespaces that are attached to the controller processing the command). If no namespaces are attached to the controller, then the log page does not contain any Reachability Group Descriptors and this field shall be cleared to 0h. |
| 15:10 | Reserved |
