| 09   | **No-Deallocate After Sanitize (NDAS):** If this bit is set to ‘1’ and the No-Deallocate Inhibited bit (refer to Figure 328) is cleared to ‘0’, then the controller shall not deallocate any media in the NVM subsystem that is allocated for user data as a result of successfully completing the NVM subsystem sanitize operation. If this bit is: |
|      | a) cleared to ‘0’; or |
