| 29   | AVE Discovery Log Page Change Notification (ADLPCN): This bit indicates that the Discovery controller reports AVE Discovery Log Page Change Notifications. If this bit is set to ‘1’, then the Discovery controller shall send a notification if AVE Discovery log page changes occur. |
