2025-12-21 04:39:24 - ocr_processor - [32mINFO[0m - [deepseek_ocr.py:182] - Processing image end: If the controller does not maintain the value of the timestamp across the most recent Controller Level Reset, then the Timestamp field is cleared to 0h due to that Controller Level Reset.

Timestamp values should not be used for security applications. Other application use of the Timestamp feature is outside the scope of this specification.

If a Set Features command is issued for this Feature, the data structure specified in Figure 414 is transferred in the data buffer for that command, specifying the Timestamp value.

