5.2.28.1 Track Send Management Operations

5.2.28.1.1 Log User Data Changes (Management Operation 0h)

The Log User Data Changes management operation of the Track Send command is used to start or stop logging user data changes to namespaces attached to the controller associated with the User Data Migration Queue (refer to section 5.2.4.1.1.1) specified in Controller Data Queue Identifier field in Command Dword 11 (refer to Figure 494).

Refer to the applicable I/O command Set specification for additional requirements.
