| 1h    | Start Logging: The controller shall start logging user data changes to namespaces attached to the controller associated with the User Data Migration Queue (refer to the CDQID field in Figure 494) into that User Data Migration Queue where those user data changes are caused by the controller associated with that User Data Migration Queue processing commands. |
