**Individual I/O Queue Deletion Support (INDIVIOQDELS):** Indicates support for deleting individual I/O Queues. If this bit is set to ‘1’, then the host supports the deletion of individual I/O Queues. If this bit is cleared to ‘0’, then the host does not support the deletion of individual I/O Queues.

