In the Connect command for an I/O Queue, this field is reserved.

**NVM Set Identifier (NVM SETID):** This field indicates the identifier of the NVM Set to be associated with this Submission Queue. This field is only valid for I/O Queues.

In the Connect command for an Admin Queue, the:

- host should clear this field to 0h;
- controller shall ignore this field; and
- Submission Queue is not associated with any NVM Set.

In the Connect command for an I/O queue, if the SQ Associations capability is not supported (refer to section 8.1.27) or this field is cleared to 0h, then this Submission Queue is not associated with any specific NVM Set.

