- the Select field set to the Suspend (i.e., 0h);
- the Suspend Type field set to Suspend (i.e., 1h);
- Delete User Data Migration Queue bit set to ‘1’, if the MMHS desires that the MMC delete the User Data Migration Queue being used to log user data changes of the Migratable Controller being migrated; and
- the Controller Identifier field (refer to Figure 367) set to the controller identifier for the Migratable Controller to be suspended (i.e., the Migratable Controller being migrated).

