| '1'    | Even               | First               | Inversion of Overwrite Pattern1    | Each byte cleared to 00h        |
|        |                     | Subsequent          | Inversion of Overwrite Pattern1 from previous pass (i.e., each bit XORed with ‘1’) |                         |
