b) if the sanitization target is a namespace (i.e., the sanitization target associated with this state machine is a namespace), then the Sanitize Operation State Machine shall transition to the Post-Verification Deallocation state if any controller in the NVM subsystem performs an Exit Media Verification State action with that namespace specified as the sanitization target;
