2025-12-21 05:13:50 - ocr_processor - [32mINFO[0m - [deepseek_ocr.py:182] - Processing image end: Figure 738: ZoneDBActive Abstract Representation

The ZoneDBConfig is a list of configured ZoneGroups and ZoneAliases, as shown in Figure 739.

Figure 739: ZoneDBConfig Abstract Representation

8.3.2.3.2 ZoneGroup

A ZoneGroup is the unit of activation (i.e., a set of access control rules enforceable by the CDC). The detailed representation of a ZoneGroup is shown in Figure 740.

Figure 740: ZoneGroup Detailed Representation

