| 256*n+127+LenP1+LenP2+...+LenPk:256*n+128+LenP1+LenP2+...+LenPk-1 | Zone Property k (ZPk): This field contains the Kth Zone property contained in this Zone (if present). The length of this field is represented as LenPk. |
