<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 149, 881, 181]]<|/det|>
Support for this property is indicated by the state of the NVM Subsystem Shutdown Supported (CAP.NSSS) field. If this property is not supported, then the address range occupied by this property is reserved.  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 187, 881, 218]]<|/det|>
The NVM Subsystem Shutdown Enhancements Supported (CAP.NSSES) bit affects the functionality invoked by host modification of this property (refer to section 3.6.3).  

