ent Memory Region have completed and are persistent.</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>Completion of Memory Read (CMR): The completion of a memory read from any Persistent Memory Region address ensures that all prior writes to the Persistent Memory Region have completed and are persistent.</td></tr></table>
