indicate support for Endurance Groups in the Controller Attributes field in the Identify Controller data structure; indicate the Endurance Group Identifier with which the namespace is associated in the Identify Namespace data structure; support the Endurance Group Information log page; and support the Endurance Group Event Aggregate log page if more than one Endurance Group is supported in the NVM subsystem.  

