<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[146, 623, 883, 668]]<|/det|>
a host writing the value 41627074h ("Abpt") to NSSD.NSSC when CAP.CPS is set to 11b; or issuing an NVMe-MI Shutdown command to a Management Endpoint (refer to the NVM Express Management Interface Specification) specifying an abrupt shutdown.  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 676, 883, 706]]<|/det|>
