<|ref|>title<|/ref|><|det|>[[115, 524, 349, 540]]<|/det|>
#### 4.2.3 Status Field Definition  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[115, 549, 883, 579]]<|/det|>
The Status field defines the status for the command indicated in the completion queue entry, defined in Figure 100.  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[115, 584, 883, 629]]<|/det|>
A value of Oh for the Status field indicates a successful command completion, with no fatal or non- fatal error conditions. Unless otherwise noted, if a command fails to complete successfully for multiple reasons, then the particular status code returned is chosen by the vendor.  

<|ref|>table<|/ref|><|det|>[[113, 666, 881, 803]]<|/det|>
