<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 281, 558, 294]]<|/det|>
For all SGL descriptors examined for errors by the controller:

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[144, 305, 883, 333]]<|/det|>
·If the controller detects an error condition listed in Figure 113, then the controller shall abort the command with the corresponding status code listed in that figure; and

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[144, 336, 191, 347]]<|/det|>
