at is the sanitization target of an in progress namespace sanitize operation.</td></tr><tr><td>84h</td><td>Sanitize</td><td>Refer to section 8.1.26.4 (i.e., the Sanitize Operation State Machine) for restrictions on processing a Sanitize command.</td></tr><tr><td>C0h to FFh</td><td>Vendor Specific</td><td>Abort the command with a status code of Sanitize Namespace In Progress if the command affects a namespace that is a sanitization target or that accesses (e.g., reads) user data from a namespace that is a sanitization target.</td></tr></table>  

