<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 678, 883, 723]]<|/det|>
Dword 0 and Dword 1 of the completion queue entry contains information about the asynchronous event. The definition of Dword 0 of the completion queue entry is in Figure 150. The definition of Dword 1 of the completion queue entry is in Figure 151.  

<|ref|>table<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 760, 881, 906]]<|/det|>
