<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 170, 883, 212]]<|/det|>
Upon completion of the Controller Data Queue command, the controller posts a completion queue entry to the Admin Completion Queue indicating the status for the command. Section 5.2.4.1 describes completion details for each management operation.

