After successful completion of a Format NVM command, the settings specified in the Format NVM command (e.g., the PI field, the MSET field, the LBAFL field, and the LBAFU field) are reported as part of the Identify Namespace data structures (refer to section 1.5.50).

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 358, 883, 386]]<|/det|>
The Format NVM command uses the Command Dword 10 field. All other command specific fields are reserved.

