#### 5.2.12.1.4 Firmware Slot Information (Log Page Identifier 03h)  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 113, 883, 158]]<|/det|>
This log page is used to describe the firmware revision stored in each firmware slot supported. The firmware revision is indicated as an ASCII string. The log page also indicates the active slot number. The log page returned is defined in Figure 212.  

<|ref|>table<|/ref|><|det|>[[113, 194, 881, 662]]<|/det|>
