<|ref|>title<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 340, 623, 357]]<|/det|>
#### 5.2.12.1.8.1 Telemetry Host-Initiated LID Specific Parameter Field  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 365, 881, 395]]<|/det|>
Figure 219 specifies the format for the LID Specific Parameter field in the Supported Log Pages log page (refer to section 5.2.12.1.1) for the Telemetry Host- Initiated log page.  

<|ref|>table<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 432, 881, 515]]<|/det|>
