ection 5.2.13.3.1). If the RCPIT field is set to 10b, then:<br>• the least-significant byte of this field shall contain the Port Identifier of the Management Endpoint (refer to the NVM Express Management Interface Specification); and<br>• the most-significant byte of this field shall be cleared to 0h.</td></tr><tr><td>479:378</td><td>Reserved</td></tr></table>
