CIe Transport Specification) at the time of the event if the error is an uncorrectable error.</td></tr><tr><td>63:48</td><td>PCle AER Header Log Register (PCIEAHLR): Contains the contents of the PCle AER Header Log Register (refer to the Advanced Error Reporting Capability section in the NVMe over PCIe Transport Specification), if supported, at the time of the event.</td></tr><tr><td>79:64</td><td>PCle AER TLP Prefix Log Register (PCIEAETPLR): Contains the contents of the PCle AER TLP Prefix Log Register (refer to the Advanced Error Reporting Capability section in the NVMe over PCIe Transport Specification), if supported, at the time of the event.</td></tr></table>
