<tr><td></td><td>89h</td><td>The Composite Temperature has transitioned from a temperature that is greater than a temperature where thermal management actions are being performed and that is not greater than or equal to WCTEMP to a temperature where thermal management actions are stopped.</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td>Low Temperature Transitions</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>B0h</td><td>The Composite Temperature has transition from a temperature that is greater than an under temperature threshold to a temperature that is less than or equal to an under temperature threshold.</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>F0h to FFh</td><td>Vendor specific</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>All other values</td><td>Reserved</td></tr></table>  

