<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[143, 258, 415, 289]]<|/det|>
Event Type field to 0Fh; and Event Type Revision field to 01h.  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 295, 518, 311]]<|/det|>
