<|ref|>title<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 444, 629, 457]]<|/det|>
# 5.2.12.1.30 Reclaim Unit Handle Usage (Log Page Identifier 21h)

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 468, 883, 525]]<|/det|>
The Reclaim Unit Handle Usage log page (refer to Figure 291) is used to provide information about the Reclaim Unit Handles associated with the Placement Handles of the namespaces in the specified Endurance Group. The Endurance Group is specified by the Endurance Group Identifier field in the Log Specific Identifier field as defined in Figure 221).

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 535, 883, 576]]<|/det|>
If Flexible Data Placement is enabled in the Endurance Group specified by the Endurance Group Identifier field and a Get Log Page command specifies the Reclaim Unit Handle Usage log page, then the NSID field in that command is reserved.

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 586, 883, 613]]<|/det|>
If Flexible Data Placement is disabled in the specified Endurance Group and the Get Log Page command specifying this log page, then the controller shall abort the command with a status code of FDP Disabled.

<|ref|>table_caption<|/ref|><|det|>[[314, 630, 700, 642]]<|/det|>
Figure 291: Reclaim Unit Handle Usage Log Page

<|ref|>table<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 653, 900, 880]]<|/det|>

<table><tr><td>Bytes</td><td>Description</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2">Header</td></tr><tr><td>01:00</td><td>Number of Reclaim Unit Handles (NRUH): This field identifies the number of Reclaim Unit Handle Usage Descriptors in the Reclaim Unit Handle Usage Descriptor List. This field shall be a non-zero value.<br>This field shall be set to the value of the NRUH field in the current FDP configuration (refer to Figure 287) for the specified Endurance Group.</td></tr><tr><td>07:02</td><td>Reserved</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2">Reclaim Unit Handle Usage Descriptor List</td></tr><tr><td>15:08</td><td>Reclaim Unit Handle Usage Descriptor 0: Contains the Reclaim Unit Handle Usage Descriptor (refer to Figure 292) for Reclaim Unit Handle 0.</td></tr><tr><td>23:16</td><td>Reclaim Unit Handle Usage Descriptor 1: Contains the Reclaim Unit Handle Usage Descriptor (refer to Figure 292) for Reclaim Unit Handle 1.</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2"></td></tr><tr><td>(NRUH-1)*8+15:<br>(NRUH-1)*8+8</td><td>Reclaim Unit Handle Usage Descriptor NRUH-1: Contains the Reclaim Unit Handle Usage Descriptor (refer to Figure 292) for Reclaim Unit Handle NRUH-1.</td></tr></table>

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 893, 608, 906]]<|/det|>
The Reclaim Unit Handle Usage Descriptor is defined in Figure 292.
