All entries are removed from this log page if the controller processes:

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[143, 114, 731, 127]]<|/det|>
·a Get Log Page command for this log page with the RAE bit cleared to '0'; or

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[143, 130, 357, 141]]<|/det|>
·a Controller Level Reset.

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 151, 883, 193]]<|/det|>
If the host connected to a Discovery subsystem using the well-known Discovery Service NQN, then the controller shall not report that this log page is supported in the Supported Log Pages log page (refer to section 5.2.12.1.1).

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 202, 392, 215]]<|/det|>
The log page is defined in Figure 306.

