<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[115, 558, 883, 589]]<|/det|>
If the controller supports selection of a UUID by the Identify command (refer to section 8.1.30), then Command Dword 14 is used to specify a UUID Index value (refer to Figure 325).  

<|ref|>table<|/ref|><|det|>[[113, 625, 881, 671]]<|/det|>
