<|ref|>title<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 432, 524, 448]]<|/det|>
#### 5.2.16.1 Migration Receive Management Operations  

<|ref|>title<|/ref|><|det|>[[137, 457, 597, 474]]<|/det|>
#### 5.2.16.1.1 Get Controller State (Management Operation Oh)  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 481, 883, 541]]<|/det|>
The Get Controller State management operation of the Migration Receive command allows the host to retrieve from the controller processing the command state data for the controller specified in the Controller Identifier field in the Management Operation Specific field (refer to Figure 361). The data returned in the data buffer is the Controller State data structure as defined by Figure 374.  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 547, 881, 578]]<|/det|>
If the controller specified in the Controller Identifier field in the Management Operation Specific field (i.e., the specified controller):  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[143, 585, 741, 617]]<|/det|>
is suspended (refer to section 5.2.17.1.1); and remains suspended during the processing of the Migration Receive command,  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 624, 155, 637]]<|/det|>
then:  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[143, 646, 640, 662]]<|/det|>
the specified controller has stopped processing commands; and  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[143, 663, 184, 676]]<|/det|>
if:  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[201, 678, 883, 735]]<|/det|>
a Controller Level Reset has not occurred on the specified controller during the processing of the Migration Receive command; or the host does not modify controller properties on the specified controller during the processing of the Migration Receive command,  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[171, 740, 883, 771]]<|/det|>
then the returned Controller State data structure is consistent between each field reported in that data structure.  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 779, 299, 794]]<|/det|>
If the specified controller:  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[143, 802, 809, 832]]<|/det|>
is not suspended during the processing of the Migration Receive command; or has a Controller Level Reset during the processing of the Migration Receive command,  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 839, 883, 869]]<|/det|>
then the specified controller state may be changing during the processing of the Migration Receive command and:
