#### 5.2.26.1.1 Arbitration (Feature Identifier 01h)  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 113, 883, 143]]<|/det|>
This Feature controls command arbitration within the controller. Refer to section 3.4.4 for command arbitration details. The attributes are specified in Command Dword 11.  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 149, 883, 179]]<|/det|>
If a Get Features command is submitted for this Feature, the attributes specified in Figure 404 are returned in Dword 0 of the completion queue entry for that command.  

