This Feature controls the volatile write cache, if present, on the controller. If a volatile write cache is present (refer to the VWC field in Figure 328), then this Feature shall be supported. The attributes are specified in Command Dword 11. 

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 768, 883, 811]]<|/det|>
