zero value, then start a timer equal to the value in the SMT field.<br>The value in the PMGN field in the Power Measurement log page (refer to Figure 297) shall be incremented prior to returning a successful completion queue entry for this Set Features command.</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>All others Reserved</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>Ch to Fh</td><td>Vendor Specific. Additional information may be provided in Command Dword 12 (refer to Figure 455).</td></tr></table>  

