<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 324, 883, 365]]<|/det|>
The requirements and use of the Host Identifier feature are dependent on whether the NVMe over PCIe implementation or the NVMe over Fabrics implementation is supported. Refer to section 5.2.26.1.32.1 and section 5.2.26.1.32.2.

