<|ref|>title<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 535, 466, 548]]<|/det|>
# 6.5 Property Get Command and Response

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 561, 883, 602]]<|/det|>
The Property Get command is used to specify the property value to return to the host (refer to section 3.1.4).The fields for the Property Get command are defined in Figure 585. If an invalid property or invalid offset is specified, then a status code of Invalid Field in Command shall be returned.

<|ref|>table_caption<|/ref|><|det|>[[252, 619, 745, 632]]<|/det|>
