The DHK is derived using a keyed-hash authentication algorithm (refer to the CDPALG field in Figure 328), whose output is the DHK that is stored in the NVM subsystem for subsequent usage during Personality Unfreeze Request operations (refer to section 8.1.6.2.1). The required DHK sizes are specified in Figure 642. 

