the host and participating NVM subsystems must manage the paths so that there is no interruption to I/O. Figure 659 shows an example of online data migration, where the contents of namespace B are migrated from one participating NVM subsystem to another participating NVM subsystem. In this figure, the lines from the host to the NVMe controllers may represent multiple connections from the host to multiple controllers in each participating NVM subsystem.  

