2025-12-21 11:28:14 - ocr_processor - [32mINFO[0m - [deepseek_ocr.py:182] - Processing image end: <|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[142, 89, 883, 120]]<|/det|>
3) Issue Set Features commands for the FDP Events feature (refer to section 5.2.26.1.21) to specify if supported FDP events are required for Reclaim Unit Handles.  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[142, 119, 883, 150]]<|/det|>
4) For each namespace in the Endurance Group that the Data Placement Directive is to be utilized by the host by write commands specifying that namespace:  

