#### 8.1.21.2 Reachability event notifications  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[115, 862, 883, 894]]<|/det|>
Reachability may generate a Reachability Group Change notice (refer to section 5.2.2.1) or a Reachability Association Change notice (refer to section 5.2.2.1).
