The Write Counter for the Device Configuration Block is independent of the Write Counter for RPMB target 0. Authenticated Device Configuration Block Writes do not affect the Write Counter for RPMB target 0 since the data is not part of the RPMB data area. The current value of the Write Counter for the Device Configuration Block may be read using an Authenticated Device Configuration Block Read (refer to section 8.1.23.4).  

