2025-12-21 11:34:06 - ocr_processor - [32mINFO[0m - [deepseek_ocr.py:182] - Processing image end: <|ref|>table_caption<|/ref|><|det|>[[257, 105, 764, 119]]<|/det|>
Figure 702: Command Behavior in the Presence of a Reservation

