then the MVCNCLD bit, in the Sanitize Status log page for the sanitization target, shall be set to '1; all controllers and Management Endpoints in the NVM subsystem shall process commands as described in section 8.1.26.5;  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[142, 575, 883, 604]]<|/det|>
g) if the sanitization target is the NVM subsystem, then all controllers in the NVM subsystem shall abort a:  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[200, 610, 465, 641]]<|/det|>
