#### 8.3.2.3.3 Zone  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 396, 883, 442]]<|/det|>
A Zone is the unit of access control. Zone members belonging to the same Zone are allowed to communicate between each other, according to the rules specified in section 8.3.2.3.4.1. The detailed representation of a Zone is shown in Figure 741.  

