- reply to the AUTH_ Negotiate message with an AUTH_Failure1 message having reason code 'Authentication failure' and reason code explanation 'Hash function not usable'; and- disconnect the NVMe over Fabrics connection upon transmitting the AUTH_Failure1 message.  

