<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[203, 642, 883, 666]]<|/det|>
O reply with an AUTH_Failure2 message having reason code 'Authentication failure' and reason code explanation 'Authentication failed'; and

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[203, 669, 574, 682]]<|/det|>
O disconnect the NVMe over Fabrics connection.

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[114, 692, 883, 720]]<|/det|>
If verification of the response value \(R_{2}\) succeeds, the controller has been authenticated and the host shall continue with a DH-HMAC-CHAP_Success2 message.

